flowchart TB
  UI[React + TypeScript\nTanStack Query / Table] -->|Same-origin JSON / secure session| API[FastAPI + Pydantic\nAuthentication / admin authorization]
  API --> Domain[Domain services\nOrganization reconciliation / reviews\nTenancy lifecycle / membership\nBaselines / overrides / drift\nCost and user observations\nRecovery access / key rotation]
  Domain --> Repo[Transactional repositories\nSQLAlchemy + Psycopg]
  Repo --> DB[(PostgreSQL\nApplication state / observations\nAudit evidence / notification outbox\nProcrastinate job queue)]
  DB -->|Claim eligible queued work| Worker[Python workers\nExecute / resume domain workflows]
  Worker -->|Progress / results / audit| Repo
  Worker --> Provider[Typed provider contracts\nTarget / credential guards]
  Provider --> Sim[Simulated adapters]
  Provider --> OCI[OCI adapters]
  Provider --> Custody[Secret-store boundary\nPrivate local custody / OCI Vault]
  Worker -->|Outbox delivery| Mail[Configured SMTP transport]
